# CODEOWNERS — paths that require an architect's review
#
# The `protect-main` ruleset sets `require_code_owner_review: true`, so a pull
# request touching any path below cannot be merged until one of the owners
# listed for that path has approved it. Everything not listed here needs the
# normal one approving review from anyone with write access.
#
# These are the paths where a mistake is not caught by `lint` or `build`:
# CI/CD definitions, the image and its runtime config, dependency pins, the
# deploy scripts that run as root on the hosts, the break-glass log, and the
# decision records themselves. The vendor (Think201, Write access) can propose
# changes to them but cannot merge them alone.
#
# Individual logins, not a team: the repo owner is an organization member, not
# an owner, so no GitHub team can be created (see ADR-002 as corrected in the
# rollout plan — the ruleset bypass actor is OrganizationAdmin instead of a
# break-glass team). Every owner listed must keep at least Write access or
# GitHub silently ignores the rule.
#
# Later entries win: a file matched by several lines takes the owners of the
# last matching line.

# CI/CD workflows, this file, the PR template, Dependabot config
/.github/                        @adammwaniki @justMuriithi

# Image definition and its runtime configuration
/Dockerfile                      @adammwaniki @justMuriithi
/docker/                         @adammwaniki @justMuriithi

# Host compose files, Caddy config, deploy scripts running as root
/deploy/                         @adammwaniki @justMuriithi

# Plugin pins — these decide what PHP code ships in the image
/composer.json                   @adammwaniki @justMuriithi
/composer.lock                   @adammwaniki @justMuriithi

# CI helpers, host provisioning and the governance script itself
/scripts/                        @adammwaniki @justMuriithi

# The break-glass log and procedure
/BREAKGLASS.md                   @adammwaniki @justMuriithi

# Architecture decision records
/docs/adr/                       @adammwaniki @justMuriithi
